    "body": "I tried working on this one but I am stuck.\r\nI figured out the fix should be done on `src/init/starship.bash`.\r\nI can save the value of `$_` easily : \r\n```bash\r\n# Save previous command's last argument, otherwise it will be set to \"starship_preexec\"\r\nPREV_LAST_ARG=$_\r\n```\r\nI thought about executing something like \r\n```bash\r\n# Restore previous command's last argument\r\necho \"${PREV_LAST_ARG}\" > /dev/null\r\n```\r\nBut I don't know where to insert this code... \r\n \r\nIn the meantime, I noticed that <kbd>Alt</kbd> + <kbd>.</kbd> still works with starship.\r\n\r\n",
